			<Comment Bounds="365 0 295 108" Id="77" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"Store the value of the tab control in a custom\nproperty of the execution. This value can be\nused later so that the user interface can\ndisplay the same tab that was displayed the last\ntime the execution was viewed.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is\nshared by multiple event callback VIs."</p.Text>
